Well, think of them as like, the toughest
 person in a school or a college or something.

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:54.170
They're the ones who always beat up the bullies.

00:02:54.170 --> 00:02:56.530
That sounds really cool!

00:02:57.460 --> 00:02:59.700
You really think so, huh?

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:05.410
Let me tell you about Boss... the Gang Boss Legend!

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:12.960
Legend of the Strongest Boss<i>!</i>

