00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:33.470
Um, we'll come some other 
time, so if you'll just excuse us!

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:35.350
Oh my...

00:05:36.000 --> 00:05:40.050
He glared at me! He glared at me! Like, right at me!

00:05:40.050 --> 00:05:41.310
Boss!

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:44.370
Why is he chasing me?!

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:50.950
Why is this happening to me?! {Why's -> Why is.}

00:05:56.270 --> 00:05:57.290
