00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:21.150
Yeah, I'm all right, thanks to him.

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:29.570
Let me help!

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:31.200
It's fine. I can handle it.

00:06:31.790 --> 00:06:34.150
You can't reach your own back, silly!

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:37.120
Huh?

00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:40.970
Oh, here. Ms. Tsurusaki asked us to give you this.

00:06:40.970 --> 00:06:42.200
