00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:47.870
He seems kinda different than how I imagined.

00:06:47.870 --> 00:06:49.100
Really?

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:52.200
Hey, why were you shushing us earlier?

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:56.230
If my mom found out I wasn't coming straight home, she'd worry about me.

00:06:56.230 --> 00:06:56.850
