00:07:06.780 --> 00:07:08.150
Whoa!

00:07:08.150 --> 00:07:09.280
I'll go get it for you!

00:07:09.280 --> 00:07:11.070
Oh no, everything's fallen out! {Added the first comma and changed the second one to a dash. Looks better IMO.}

00:07:11.340 --> 00:07:12.030
