00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:14.280
Don't read it!

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:17.250
Is this... a comic?

00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:18.080
And isn't this...

00:07:18.460 --> 00:07:19.790
...Precure?!

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:24.290
I never would've guessed you were drawing comics. {Fixed 'manga' pluralization.}

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:26.660
Why is it about Precure?

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:28.360
Well, they're cute...

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:32.190
You'd better keep quiet about this!

00:07:32.190 --> 00:07:35.270
E-Even Mom doesn't know about this.

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:37.720
Because you don't want to worry her?

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:38.720
Yeah...

00:07:39.130 --> 00:07:43.630
My mother's always raised me quite strictly, 
never caring for comics and cartoons and the like.

00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:47.530
If I told her I wanted to become a comic 
artist, it'd only make her worry about me.

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:53.090
So that's why you've been drawing it in secret on the way home?

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:55.480
You're surprisingly gentle, Boss.

00:07:55.480 --> 00:07:58.340
That whole "Boss" thing is just an annoying rumor. {As awesome as tittle-tattle is, it's a bit jarringly out of place.}

00:07:58.340 --> 00:07:59.450
What really happened?

00:07:59.740 --> 00:08:04.350
Well, I had writer's block at the time, and was annoyed I couldn't think of any material...

