00:08:54.770 --> 00:08:57.700
Today, once again, they protect the peace in our town!

00:08:57.700 --> 00:08:59.430
Cure Blossom and Cure Marine!

00:08:59.870 --> 00:09:01.930
Is it just me, or has his personality just radically shifted?

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:04.000
Yup. He seems to be enjoying himself!

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:07.600
However, there's a man that Cure Blossom has fallen for!

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:08.810
Whaaaaat?!

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:10.180
Is it really that shocking?

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:11.730
