00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:16.210
That man is the shy Ken, who 
loves flowers with all his heart!

00:09:16.210 --> 00:09:22.160
However, Blossom knows that Marine secretly also has feelings for Ken!

00:09:22.160 --> 00:09:23.590
Whaaaaat?!

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:25.710
Sorry, please go on.

00:09:26.360 --> 00:09:29.320
Though Blossom is unsure what to do, she reaches a decision.

00:09:29.320 --> 00:09:33.710
She will become their Cupid, 
and help Marine win Ken's heart!

00:09:34.090 --> 00:09:36.280
That's a pretty cliché plot twist...

00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:37.420
It's brilliant...

00:09:37.420 --> 00:09:38.240
