00:09:44.740 --> 00:09:50.200
The truth is, I was going to enter this into a competition, but the deadline's tomorrow.

00:09:50.200 --> 00:09:52.800
I've worked really hard on it, 
but it seems I won't finish in time.

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:55.890
In that case, how about we help?

00:09:55.890 --> 00:09:56.360
Huh?

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:58.160
You two will?

00:09:58.160 --> 00:09:58.820
Yeah!

00:09:59.980 --> 00:10:02.540
We don't have school tomorrow, after all.

00:10:02.540 --> 00:10:04.880
Drawing a comic book seems like it'd be fun. 

00:10:04.880 --> 00:10:08.330
And if you don't want to worry your 
mom, then we can do it at our place! {round -> at}

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:09.540
Is this really okay? {Can we keep this line around a tiny bit longer?}

00:10:09.860 --> 00:10:11.460
It's a-okay! {OKAAAAAAAAY in English lol}

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:13.670
Battles and friendship...

00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:16.380
Battles! And friendship! {Make the onscreen shake too, lol.}

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:19.300
This one-two punch of battles and friendship!

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:25.870
I wish nothing more than to face this fiery Gang Boss in manly combat!

00:10:43.390 --> 00:10:46.300
So then you just draw over the sketches in pen like this.

00:10:46.300 --> 00:10:47.320
Then erase them.

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:48.950
Fill in each segment.

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:52.080
If you go over the edges, just white it out.

00:10:52.440 --> 00:10:53.960
Wow!

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:56.090
It's almost life-like!

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:58.420
All right then, let's get started!

00:10:58.830 --> 00:10:59.630
Yeah!

00:11:06.620 --> 00:11:08.850
Filler! I need you to fill in each of the segments!

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:10.100
Leave it to me!

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:12.760
Whiter! I need you to fix where I've gone over the lines!

00:11:12.760 --> 00:11:13.440
Right!

00:11:16.520 --> 00:11:18.370
Kurumi, you've gone way over the edges!

00:11:18.370 --> 00:11:19.490
I'm sorry!

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:23.280
I accidentally erased his outline!

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:25.800
Don't worry, I'll redraw it!

00:11:25.800 --> 00:11:29.210
But first, worry about the screentone on Blossom and Marine!

00:11:29.210 --> 00:11:30.870
We've done it!

00:11:32.970 --> 00:11:34.790
Huh? I just heard a weird voice...

00:11:34.790 --> 00:11:36.940
Y-You're just imagining things!

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:39.610
More importantly, where's the next page? {DAT FACE}

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:40.720
Well, I...

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:44.670
I haven't decided how the story should go from here.

00:11:44.670 --> 00:11:46.260
Huuuuh?!

00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:49.670
I thought I'd have the last scene be 

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:55.650
where Blossom and Marine reconcile after fighting about their feelings for Ken.

00:11:55.650 --> 00:11:59.360
So we just have to act out a scene, and you can create the story from there, right?

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:01.650
I wonder if I can really do that.

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:02.910
You're an actress!

00:12:02.910 --> 00:12:03.360
What?

00:12:03.620 --> 00:12:05.570
You just have to imagine you're an actress, Tsubomi! {Updated 'U OOZ' plz}

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:07.140
A-All right!

00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:14.000
<i>I am an actress... I am an actress...</i>

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:15.770
<i>An actress! I'm an actress!</i>

00:12:17.730 --> 00:12:20.050
It's just as you say, Marine!

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:22.300
I love Ken too!

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:25.430
<i>Not bad, Tsubomi! But two can play at that game.</i>

00:12:25.900 --> 00:12:27.320
Why?!

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:29.930
Why couldn't you have just told me that before?!

00:12:30.320 --> 00:12:32.270
Marine, you once told me...

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:35.940
that it's being together that makes us Precure!

00:12:36.700 --> 00:12:41.740
I may love him, but being a 
Precure is more important to me!

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:43.900
I feel the same!

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:45.500
I don't need love!

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:46.660
Together...

00:12:47.060 --> 00:12:48.660
We are Pretty Cure!

00:12:50.440 --> 00:12:51.830
Cure Marine...

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:53.580
Cure Blossom...

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:54.970
I'm...

00:12:55.590 --> 00:12:57.580
touched to my very core!

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:00.960
I've thought of the last scene! Let's get this finished!

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:02.300
Erika!

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:05.720
His mom's come to pay us a visit.

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:06.430
Huh?!

00:13:06.430 --> 00:13:08.050
Mother has?!

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:11.560
Erika!

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:12.890
How long are you going to keep us waiting?

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:14.120
It's very rude of you!

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:15.600
Just a sec!

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:16.810
Over here!

00:13:17.340 --> 00:13:18.110
We're coming in!

00:13:19.420 --> 00:13:21.360
Sorry to make you wait like this.

00:13:24.010 --> 00:13:25.020
What've you been doing?

00:13:25.020 --> 00:13:27.470
W-We've been studying, of course!

00:13:27.470 --> 00:13:29.320
Sorry to interrupt you like this.

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:34.150
I thought that as long as you were helping out my Ken, I should at least come and introduce myself. {added 'long as' - it's a more American figure of speech, less stilted.}

00:13:35.320 --> 00:13:37.170
Huh? Erika...

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:39.080
Why have you closed the curtains?

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:40.380
Th-They've been acting up!

00:13:40.760 --> 00:13:41.840
What?

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:44.170
I wonder what's wrong with them...

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:46.200
Oh?

00:13:52.550 --> 00:13:53.360
This is...

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:56.500
W-Well you see, he wanted to study, but...

00:13:56.500 --> 00:13:59.420
Right, right, we said we wanted to draw a comic book, and...

00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:00.270
It's fine.

00:14:00.270 --> 00:14:01.190
Huh?

00:14:02.140 --> 00:14:03.110
Mother.

00:14:03.850 --> 00:14:05.070
The person who drew this...

00:14:05.600 --> 00:14:06.240
was me. {it is me i am the manga kid}

00:14:06.500 --> 00:14:10.120
But you told me that you were 
studying at a friend's house tonight.

00:14:11.140 --> 00:14:12.860
I lied to you.

00:14:12.860 --> 00:14:14.750
My Ken... 

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:16.820
lied to me?!

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:19.170
I'm sorry!

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:20.330
Ken!

00:14:24.260 --> 00:14:27.840
<i>My mother trusted me so much, and yet I lied to her!</i>

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:31.650
<i>And she knows I was drawing that in secret too...</i>

00:14:31.650 --> 00:14:33.900
<i>I won't be able to draw anymore after this!</i>

00:14:35.550 --> 00:14:38.740
<i>But my dream has always been to become a comic artist...</i>

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:41.840
<i>What should I do now?!</i>

00:14:44.260 --> 00:14:46.000
<i>I've finally found him.</i>

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:48.240
<i>The Legendary Gang Boss!</i>

00:14:51.180 --> 00:14:51.850
<i>Hrm?</i>

00:14:56.080 --> 00:14:57.870
What <i>is</i> this garbage?!

00:14:58.710 --> 00:15:00.290
Who the heck are you?!

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:04.250
I am a Commander of the Desert Apostles... Kumojacky!

00:15:04.510 --> 00:15:07.910
The likes of you, who would draw a 
comic about those loathsome Precure{lit. 'my arch enemies, the Precures' but that'd be REALLY clunky.}

00:15:07.910 --> 00:15:10.690
belong not on the field of battle!

00:15:19.190 --> 00:15:22.330
You're up, Desertrian!

00:15:24.580 --> 00:15:26.230
Filler filler!

00:15:28.460 --> 00:15:29.290
Did you find him?

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:30.110
Not yet.

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:31.120
Filler filler!

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:34.450
That was...

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:36.410
Boss's Flower of the Heart...

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:37.590
is the one that was stolen!

00:15:37.590 --> 00:15:38.160
Huh?!

00:15:38.960 --> 00:15:41.270
We have to hurry and save him!

00:15:41.270 --> 00:15:42.420
Right!

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:56.100
Go forth, Seeds of the Precure!

00:15:59.260 --> 00:16:00.490
Precure!

00:16:00.490 --> 00:16:02.060
Open My Heart!

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:49.990
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:55.090
Cure Blossom!

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:00.550
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:17:03.550 --> 00:17:05.140
Cure Marine!

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:12.500
HeartCatch Precure!

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:17.890
Filler filler! Filler!

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:21.160
To use me as your brush shows surprising promise!

00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:22.520
Kumojacky!

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:24.270
So this is your doing!

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:26.020
Filleeeeeeeeeeer!

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:27.560
Get them, Desertrian!

00:17:28.570 --> 00:17:29.150
Filler!

00:17:35.050 --> 00:17:36.820
Not bad, not bad at all!

00:17:38.140 --> 00:17:40.530
Big Boss...

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:44.330
Even outside the comic book, it's being together that makes us Precure!

00:17:44.330 --> 00:17:46.250
Right! Let's do this together!

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:49.170
Kumojacky Special!

00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:52.960
Marine Shoot!

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:57.050
Blossom Shower!

00:17:57.460 --> 00:17:58.390
Take this!

00:18:01.100 --> 00:18:03.980
Ken! Where have you gone?!

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:05.060
What?

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:10.270
Filleeeeer...

00:18:11.140 --> 00:18:13.440
Tch! You aren't bad at all.

00:18:15.210 --> 00:18:17.910
I just wanted to draw my comic book.

00:18:19.940 --> 00:18:24.080
My dream has always been to become a comic artist!

00:18:25.760 --> 00:18:28.670
But that'd just make my mother worry about me,

00:18:29.320 --> 00:18:32.590
which is why I can never tell her!

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:35.240
I can never fill in the words... {This is a bad pun. A REALLY, REALLY bad pun. He's saying he's a 'kuchibeta' - 口下手 【くちべた】 (adj-na,n) slowness of speech; poor talker; tongue-tied person - but 'beta' is also Japanese for the filler ink his Desertrian is made of. Fuck you, Japanese.}

00:18:35.240 --> 00:18:36.770
I just want...

00:18:39.420 --> 00:18:40.440
Hmph!

00:18:40.440 --> 00:18:42.260
What a weak form you've taken.

00:18:42.840 --> 00:18:46.220
Someone as spineless as you is incapable of drawing hot-blooded comics!

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:48.890
He's not spineless!

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:50.930
He's kinder than you could possibly imagine!

00:18:50.930 --> 00:18:54.040
A boss has no need of kindness.

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:55.780
Strength is all they require.

00:18:56.180 --> 00:18:59.740
True strength is born from true kindness!

00:19:00.090 --> 00:19:03.520
You're just playing with that kind heart of his.

00:19:03.520 --> 00:19:07.120
I've had it up to here with this!

00:19:15.650 --> 00:19:18.470
Gather, Floral Power!

00:19:20.000 --> 00:19:22.140
Blossom Tact!

00:19:23.540 --> 00:19:25.560
Marine Tact!

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:33.210
Gather, Dual Floral Power!

00:19:34.060 --> 00:19:39.310
Precure Floral Power Fortissimo!

00:19:49.420 --> 00:19:51.780
Heart Catch!

00:20:07.520 --> 00:20:11.480
We shall settle this once and for all next we meet, so prepare yourselves, Precures!

00:20:18.670 --> 00:20:20.720
Ken? Are you all right?

00:20:20.720 --> 00:20:21.800
Mother...

00:20:21.800 --> 00:20:24.160
I just had the most terrible nightmare. {He just says 'dream', but I want to differentiate from four lines down.}

00:20:24.480 --> 00:20:27.090
I'm just glad you're all right, Ken.

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:29.360
Mother...

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:31.640
No, it's nothing.

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:34.790
Ken, will you tell me about your dream?

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:35.580
What?

00:20:36.720 --> 00:20:40.470
Well, the truth is I want to be a 
comic book artist when I grow up.

00:20:41.060 --> 00:20:44.590
I know to you, it seems I want to enter a 
world that'll bring me nothing but misery,

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:48.330
but I want to chase that dream with everything I've got.

00:20:48.330 --> 00:20:51.330
Well, you'll always have my support.

00:20:52.610 --> 00:20:53.560
You mean it?!

00:20:53.560 --> 00:20:55.270
Of course I do!

00:20:55.530 --> 00:20:59.230
What kind of parent wouldn't support their child?

00:21:00.490 --> 00:21:01.800
Mother...

00:21:04.220 --> 00:21:08.440
In the language of flowers, a flowering dogwood means "I want you to accept my feelings."

00:21:08.440 --> 00:21:13.350
Though I think she probably 
would've accepted them all along. {been accepting -> accepted}

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:19.170
I think a Heart Seed's about to be born...

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:34.040
With this, the Great Heart Tree has recovered a little more!

00:21:35.060 --> 00:21:35.690
S{*\fs55.333\fax-0.453}p{*\fs55.667\fax-0.457}e{*\fs56\fax-0.46}c{*\fs56.333\fax-0.463}i{*\fs56.667\fax-0.467}a{*\fs57\fax-0.47}l {*\fs57.667\fax-0.477}D{*\fs58\fax-0.48}e{*\fs58.333\fax-0.483}l{*\fs58.667\fax-0.487}i{*\fs59\fax-0.49}v{*\fs59.333\fax-0.493}e{*\fs59.667\fax-0.497}ry

00:21:36.410 --> 00:21:38.880
Thanks to you two, we just about made it in time.

00:21:38.880 --> 00:21:42.190
And when my mom read the finished book, she said it was pretty good.

00:21:42.750 --> 00:21:44.360
This is just fantastic!

00:21:44.750 --> 00:21:46.820
It'd be great if you got first place.

00:21:46.820 --> 00:21:49.990
It feels good when you manage to take a step closer to your dream.

00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:51.330
Hey...

00:21:51.610 --> 00:21:53.960
Would you be willing to help me out again?

00:21:53.960 --> 00:21:54.570
Of course!

00:21:54.570 --> 00:21:55.920
Okay by me!

00:21:55.920 --> 00:21:59.250
In that case, which magazine 
should we try submitting it to?!

00:21:59.250 --> 00:22:01.990
I like the sound of Girls' Cosmos!

00:22:01.990 --> 00:22:03.460
Yeah, that's a good one!

00:22:09.840 --> 00:22:09.870
{ED}

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:18.810
HeartCatch!

00:22:20.560 --> 00:22:21.730
HeartCatch!

00:22:23.440 --> 00:22:24.650
HeartCatch!

00:22:24.940 --> 00:22:27.610
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:36.160
The flower blooms with an "Open sesame!"

00:22:36.790 --> 00:22:39.130
In the wardrobe of my heart

00:22:39.670 --> 00:22:42.290
are all the things that a girl loves

00:22:42.590 --> 00:22:44.750
Look, they're packed in so tight

00:22:45.300 --> 00:22:48.130
My makeover was a huge success

00:22:48.470 --> 00:22:50.720
thanks to this scrunchie and this frilly tunic!

00:22:51.430 --> 00:22:53.720
Our girly showtime

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:56.560
is about to begin!

00:22:57.060 --> 00:22:59.770
Is my coordination lookin' good today?

00:22:59.890 --> 00:23:02.690
Shuffle! Colorful! Beautiful!

00:23:02.980 --> 00:23:05.610
Mismatches are just part of my character v(^^)v

00:23:05.860 --> 00:23:07.150
We're pretty

00:23:07.320 --> 00:23:08.950
at full bloom!

00:23:09.610 --> 00:23:12.070
If you polish your heart

00:23:12.490 --> 00:23:15.120
until it shines

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:16.660
Then even the darkness

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:20.910
will become a guiding light

00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:23.920
So don't sulk

00:23:24.130 --> 00:23:26.840
because a smile's the best!

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:30.300
Let's make them bloom, facing the sun

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:33.510
The flowers of our hearts

00:23:35.180 --> 00:23:36.390
HeartCatch!

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:39.890
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.810 --> 00:23:45.550
<i>A photo is a memory carved from light and emotions!</i>

00:23:45.550 --> 00:23:48.570
<i>At his daughter's side, the father clicks the 
shutter and captures all her emotions on film!</i>

00:23:48.570 --> 00:23:49.570
<i>It's so beautiful!</i>

00:23:49.570 --> 00:23:52.030
<i>If I became a bride, do you think my dad would be lonely too?</i>

00:23:52.030 --> 00:23:53.570
<i>He'd be lonely and miserable!</i>

00:23:53.870 --> 00:23:56.300
<i>But he'd hold back his tears for you!{if you want to rephrase this to be longer just do so and I'll split it into two lines, but this is tolerable and fits on one.}</i>

00:23:56.300 --> 00:23:58.410
<i>Now, let's have you and your dad take a photo together!</i>

00:23:58.410 --> 00:24:01.460
<i>All your feelings will be captured by this one click of the shutter!</i>

00:24:02.120 --> 00:24:03.540
HeartCatch Precure<i>:</i>

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:06.540
A Wedding in Tears<i>!</i>

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:06.540
A Wedding in Tears<i>!</i>

00:24:06.880 --> 00:24:09.060
<i>We'll catch everyone's hearts!</i>
